      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;This one is 5 Chapters. Because even complicated fictional queer teenagers deserve a sexy, exciting adulthood.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"As the laughter grew soft and heads laid down in the dwindling firelight, Adora rolled over - flopping an arm down onto the marble floor.  She caught Catraâ€™s bright eyes in the growing darkness just a few feet away. They held each otherâ€™s gaze for a moment, content. Adora smiled gently, and felt Catraâ€™s fingers graze her outstretched arm - softly drawing along its length with tantalising restraint.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora felt a new kind of tension rise as she realised all at once how much time had passed. The last time she and Catra had felt this connected, they were teenagers. They were young women now, and the pull they felt towards each other was more powerful, more complex - almost urgent..."&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
